ok - auto-arm: a host rewake refused on an acknowledged marker parks the host again and delivers its next close
ok - auto-arm: a host rewake refused past the re-park bound delivers the failure notice
ok - auto-arm: a lost host hand-back notifies once per failure episode
ok - auto-arm: a lost host hand-back on an announced marker notifies once per failure episode
ok - auto-arm: a host that stood down closes silently without a retry
ok - auto-arm: a host that died without a close is retried, then reported as a failure
